$$ c2.dll loads at its preferred base 0x10700000 (no symbols, so absolute addresses are used)
$$ stop when c2.dll (the VC6 optimizer) is loaded, then break in its global register allocator
sxe ld:c2.dll
g
$$ FUN_1072450d builds the priority list of register candidates (head pointer at 0x1079d864)
bp 0x1072450d "gu; $$>a<dumplist.cdb; g"
g
q
